WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.870
"I know!" said Cat.

2
00:00:08.871 --> 00:00:12.224
"We can play in the barn."

3
00:00:12.225 --> 00:00:18.110
"Play what?" said Pig.

4
00:00:18.111 --> 00:00:27.733
"We can play What Is It?" said Cat.

5
00:00:27.734 --> 00:00:32.139
"I see something yellow," said Cat.

6
00:00:32.140 --> 00:00:36.591
"What is it?"

7
00:00:36.592 --> 00:00:45.458
Pig and Cow looked around.

8
00:00:45.459 --> 00:00:51.188
"Is it hay?" said Pig.

9
00:00:51.189 --> 00:00:57.609
"No, it is not hay," said Cat.

10
00:00:57.610 --> 00:01:03.087
"Is it the light?" said Cow.

11
00:01:03.088 --> 00:01:09.447
"No, it is not the light," said Cat.

12
00:01:09.448 --> 00:01:16.025
"Is it the boot?" said Pig.

13
00:01:16.026 --> 00:01:22.582
"Yes! It is the yellow boot!" said Cat.

14
00:01:22.583 --> 00:01:25.567
"Now, Pig," said Cat.

15
00:01:25.568 --> 00:01:34.130
"You say what you see!"

16
00:01:34.131 --> 00:01:39.175
"I see something blue," said Pig.

17
00:01:39.176 --> 00:01:42.246
"It is something new."

18
00:01:42.247 --> 00:01:56.878
Cow and Cat looked around.

19
00:01:56.879 --> 00:02:02.400
But they did not see anything.

20
00:02:02.401 --> 00:02:11.527
"If you guess," said Pig, "I will take you for a ride!"

